# Kutzil's Flanker, first mode: "for each creature that left the battlefield". A flickered Ornithopter returns as a new
# object (CR 400.7), so when it is then Bolted two creatures have left, not one. On turn 3 Bot1 blinks its Ornithopter
# with Ephemerate, Bolts it, and flashes in the Flanker: two counters, a 5/3.

